{"id":"4400f4836786a4bd","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-oracle-computation.md","title":"预言机计算与可接受编号","display":"df-oracle-computation — 预言机计算与可接受编号","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-oracle-computation","aliases":["43-df-oracle-computation"],"display":"df-oracle-computation — 预言机计算与可接受编号","depends_on":["[[43-df-tm]]","[[43-df-effective-coding]]","[[43-df-infseq]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.1 Property 5.1.3, §5.4.1 and Lemma 5.4.1, print pp.7–8,13–14 / PDF pp.27–28,33–34","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-oracle-computation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-oracle-computation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oracle-computation — 预言机计算与可接受编号"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"267fe4584e3c0212\" href=\"?note=267fe4584e3c0212\" title=\"43-df-tm\">43-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.1 Property 5.1.3, §5.4.1 and Lemma 5.4.1, print pp.7–8,13–14 / PDF pp.27–28,33–34"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,s,y,i,j,v,t\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,x,s,y,i,j,v,t\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal O\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal O\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O,\\operatorname{AsSet}\">\\(\\mathcal O,\\operatorname{AsSet}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>，配对投影与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DecSeq}\">\\(\\operatorname{DecSeq}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a>。程序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_e\">\\(P_e\\)</span> 为自然数指令的有限序列；配置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i,r)\">\\((i,r)\\)</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为指令位置，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(r:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为有限支撑寄存器赋值。指令余数0、1、2、3分别表示增加、带零测试的递减、oracle查询分支和输出；跳转至程序外输出0。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathcal R\">\\(r\\in\\mathcal R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in[\\mathbb N]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(Q\\in[\\mathbb N]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_e^A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(\\delta_e^A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_e:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(O_e:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_e:\\mathcal C\\to[\\mathbb N]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(q_e:\\mathcal C\\to[\\mathbb N]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_e\">\\(H_e\\)</span> 是配置域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 上的谓词。以下递归均在自然数上。末两式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:D\\rightharpoonup E\">\\(f:D\\rightharpoonup E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:F\\rightharpoonup E\">\\(g:F\\rightharpoonup E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in D\">\\(x\\in D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in F\">\\(z\\in F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{graph}\">\\(\\operatorname{graph}\\)</span> 表示部分函数的有序对图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R:=\\{r\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}:|\\{j:r(j)\\ne0\\}|&lt;\\infty\\},\\qquad\\mathcal C:=\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R,\\qquad P_e:=\\operatorname{DecSeq}(e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R:=\\{r\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}:|\\{j:r(j)\\ne0\\}|&lt;\\infty\\},\\qquad\\mathcal C:=\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R,\\qquad P_e:=\\operatorname{DecSeq}(e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"r[j\\mapsto v]:=(r\\upharpoonright(\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{j\\}))\\cup\\{(j,v)\\},\\qquad I_e(i):=\\begin{cases}P_e(i),&amp;i&lt;|P_e|,\\\\3,&amp;i\\ge|P_e|.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[r[j\\mapsto v]:=(r\\upharpoonright(\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{j\\}))\\cup\\{(j,v)\\},\\qquad I_e(i):=\\begin{cases}P_e(i),&amp;i&lt;|P_e|,\\\\3,&amp;i\\ge|P_e|.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t_e(i):=I_e(i)\\bmod4,\\quad a_e(i):=\\lfloor I_e(i)/4\\rfloor,\\quad b_e(i):=\\pi_0(a_e(i)),\\quad j_e(i):=\\pi_0(\\pi_1(a_e(i))),\\quad k_e(i):=\\pi_1(\\pi_1(a_e(i))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t_e(i):=I_e(i)\\bmod4,\\quad a_e(i):=\\lfloor I_e(i)/4\\rfloor,\\quad b_e(i):=\\pi_0(a_e(i)),\\quad j_e(i):=\\pi_0(\\pi_1(a_e(i))),\\quad k_e(i):=\\pi_1(\\pi_1(a_e(i))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_e(i,r)\\iff t_e(i)=3,\\qquad O_e(i,r):=\\begin{cases}r(a_e(i)),&amp;i&lt;|P_e|,\\\\0,&amp;i\\ge|P_e|.\\end{cases}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_e(i,r)\\iff t_e(i)=3,\\qquad O_e(i,r):=\\begin{cases}r(a_e(i)),&amp;i&lt;|P_e|,\\\\0,&amp;i\\ge|P_e|.\\end{cases}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta_e^A(i,r):=\\begin{cases}\n(\\pi_1(a_e(i)),r[b_e(i)\\mapsto r(b_e(i))+1]),&amp;t_e(i)=0,\\\\\n(j_e(i),r[b_e(i)\\mapsto r(b_e(i))-1]),&amp;t_e(i)=1\\land r(b_e(i))&gt;0,\\\\\n(k_e(i),r),&amp;t_e(i)=1\\land r(b_e(i))=0,\\\\\n(j_e(i),r),&amp;t_e(i)=2\\land r(b_e(i))\\in\\operatorname{AsSet}(A),\\\\\n(k_e(i),r),&amp;t_e(i)=2\\land r(b_e(i))\\notin\\operatorname{AsSet}(A),\\\\\n(i,r),&amp;t_e(i)=3.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta_e^A(i,r):=\\begin{cases}\n(\\pi_1(a_e(i)),r[b_e(i)\\mapsto r(b_e(i))+1]),&amp;t_e(i)=0,\\\\\n(j_e(i),r[b_e(i)\\mapsto r(b_e(i))-1]),&amp;t_e(i)=1\\land r(b_e(i))&gt;0,\\\\\n(k_e(i),r),&amp;t_e(i)=1\\land r(b_e(i))=0,\\\\\n(j_e(i),r),&amp;t_e(i)=2\\land r(b_e(i))\\in\\operatorname{AsSet}(A),\\\\\n(k_e(i),r),&amp;t_e(i)=2\\land r(b_e(i))\\notin\\operatorname{AsSet}(A),\\\\\n(i,r),&amp;t_e(i)=3.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q_e(i,r):=\\begin{cases}\\{r(b_e(i))\\},&amp;t_e(i)=2,\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;t_e(i)\\ne2.\\end{cases}\\qquad r_x(j):=\\begin{cases}x,&amp;j=0,\\\\0,&amp;j&gt;0.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q_e(i,r):=\\begin{cases}\\{r(b_e(i))\\},&amp;t_e(i)=2,\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;t_e(i)\\ne2.\\end{cases}\\qquad r_x(j):=\\begin{cases}x,&amp;j=0,\\\\0,&amp;j&gt;0.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c_e^A(x,0):=(0,r_x),\\qquad c_e^A(x,s+1):=\\delta_e^A(c_e^A(x,s)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c_e^A(x,0):=(0,r_x),\\qquad c_e^A(x,s+1):=\\delta_e^A(c_e^A(x,s)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Exec}(e,A,x,s,y,Q)\\iff H_e(c_e^A(x,s))\\land(\\forall t&lt;s\\;\\neg H_e(c_e^A(x,t)))\\land y=O_e(c_e^A(x,s))\\land Q=\\bigcup_{t&lt;s}q_e(c_e^A(x,t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Exec}(e,A,x,s,y,Q)\\iff H_e(c_e^A(x,s))\\land(\\forall t&lt;s\\;\\neg H_e(c_e^A(x,t)))\\land y=O_e(c_e^A(x,s))\\land Q=\\bigcup_{t&lt;s}q_e(c_e^A(x,t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{graph}(\\Phi_e^A):=\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Q\\in[\\mathbb N]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{Exec}(e,A,x,s,y,Q)\\},\\qquad\\varphi_e^A:=\\Phi_e^A,\\qquad\\varphi_e:=\\Phi_e^\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{graph}(\\Phi_e^A):=\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Q\\in[\\mathbb N]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{Exec}(e,A,x,s,y,Q)\\},\\qquad\\varphi_e^A:=\\Phi_e^A,\\qquad\\varphi_e:=\\Phi_e^\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\iff(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(\\Phi_e^A),\\quad\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow\\iff x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^A),\\quad\\Phi_e^A(x)\\uparrow\\iff x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\iff(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(\\Phi_e^A),\\quad\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow\\iff x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^A),\\quad\\Phi_e^A(x)\\uparrow\\iff x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{graph}(u_e^A):=\\{(x,m)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\\exists s,y,Q\\;(\\operatorname{Exec}(e,A,x,s,y,Q)\\land m=\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{j+1:j\\in Q\\}))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{graph}(u_e^A):=\\{(x,m)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\\exists s,y,Q\\;(\\operatorname{Exec}(e,A,x,s,y,Q)\\land m=\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{j+1:j\\in Q\\}))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{graph}(\\Phi_e^\\tau):=\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Q\\subseteq|\\tau|\\;(\\chi_A\\upharpoonright|\\tau|=\\tau\\land\\operatorname{Exec}(e,A,x,s,y,Q))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{graph}(\\Phi_e^\\tau):=\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Q\\subseteq|\\tau|\\;(\\chi_A\\upharpoonright|\\tau|=\\tau\\land\\operatorname{Exec}(e,A,x,s,y,Q))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^\\tau(x)\\downarrow=y\\iff(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(\\Phi_e^\\tau),\\qquad\\Phi_e^\\tau(x)\\downarrow\\iff x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^\\tau),\\qquad\\Phi_e^\\tau(x)\\uparrow\\iff x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_e^\\tau(x)\\downarrow=y\\iff(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(\\Phi_e^\\tau),\\qquad\\Phi_e^\\tau(x)\\downarrow\\iff x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^\\tau),\\qquad\\Phi_e^\\tau(x)\\uparrow\\iff x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\simeq g\\iff\\operatorname{graph}(f)=\\operatorname{graph}(g).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\simeq g\\iff\\operatorname{graph}(f)=\\operatorname{graph}(g).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f(x)\\simeq g(z)\\iff(x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\land z\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(g))\\lor\\exists v\\in E\\;((x,v)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(f)\\land(z,v)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(g)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f(x)\\simeq g(z)\\iff(x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\land z\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(g))\\lor\\exists v\\in E\\;((x,v)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(f)\\land(z,v)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(g)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限寄存器程序给出原有预言机接口的一种明确实现；它与通常Turing程序可有效互相模拟。任意有限程序均有序列代码，程序可包含固定参数和模拟另一程序，因而适用于后续参数化与递归定理。所有配置转移均总定义且确定；Exec要求首次停机，查询集合由先前各步精确给出。使用量只在停机域上定义；有限oracle计算通过查询集合包含关系定义，不访问未定义的使用量。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：§5.1 Property 5.1.3, §5.4.1 and Lemma 5.4.1, print pp.7–8,13–14 / PDF pp.27–28,33–34。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"267fe4584e3c0212","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e,x,s,y,i,j,v,t\\in\\mathbb N$，$A\\in\\mathcal O$、$\\tau\\in2^{<\\omega}$；$\\mathcal O,\\operatorname{AsSet}$ 采用 [[43-df-infseq]]，配对投影与 $\\operatorname{DecSeq}$ 采用 [[43-df-effective-coding]]。程序 $P_e$ 为自然数指令的有限序列；配置 $(i,r)$ 中 $i\\in\\mathbb N$ 为指令位置，$r:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 为有限支撑寄存器赋值。指令余数0、1、2、3分别表示增加、带零测试的递减、oracle查询分支和输出；跳转至程序外输出0。$r\\in\\mathcal R$、$Q\\in[\\mathbb N]^{<\\omega}$；$\\delta_e^A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$、$O_e:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbb N$、$q_e:\\mathcal C\\to[\\mathbb N]^{<\\omega}$，$H_e$ 是配置域 $\\mathcal C$ 上的谓词。以下递归均在自然数上。末两式中 $f:D\\rightharpoonup E$、$g:F\\rightharpoonup E$、$x\\in D$、$z\\in F$，$\\operatorname{graph}$ 表示部分函数的有序对图。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e,x,s,y,i,j,v,t\\in\\mathbb N$，$A\\in\\mathcal O$、$\\tau\\in2^{<\\omega}$；$\\mathcal O,\\operatorname{AsSet}$ 采用 [[43-df-infseq]]，配对投影与 $\\operatorname{DecSeq}$ 采用 [[43-df-effective-coding]]。程序 $P_e$ 为自然数指令的有限序列；配置 $(i,r)$ 中 $i\\in\\mathbb N$ 为指令位置，$r:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 为有限支撑寄存器赋值。指令余数0、1、2、3分别表示增加、带零测试的递减、oracle查询分支和输出；跳转至程序外输出0。$r\\in\\mathcal R$、$Q\\in[\\mathbb N]^{<\\omega}$；$\\delta_e^A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$、$O_e:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbb N$、$q_e:\\mathcal C\\to[\\mathbb N]^{<\\omega}$，$H_e$ 是配置域 $\\mathcal C$ 上的谓词。以下递归均在自然数上。末两式中 $f:D\\rightharpoonup E$、$g:F\\rightharpoonup E$、$x\\in D$、$z\\in F$，$\\operatorname{graph}$ 表示部分函数的有序对图。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"e,x,s,y,i,j,v,t\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O,\\operatorname{AsSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DecSeq}","display":false},{"tex":"P_e","display":false},{"tex":"(i,r)","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"r:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\in[\\mathbb N]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_e^A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"O_e:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"q_e:\\mathcal C\\to[\\mathbb N]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"H_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"f:D\\rightharpoonup E","display":false},{"tex":"g:F\\rightharpoonup E","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{graph}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R:=\\{r\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}:|\\{j:r(j)\\ne0\\}|<\\infty\\},\\qquad\\mathcal C:=\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R,\\qquad P_e:=\\operatorname{DecSeq}(e).","display":true},{"tex":"r[j\\mapsto v]:=(r\\upharpoonright(\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{j\\}))\\cup\\{(j,v)\\},\\qquad I_e(i):=\\begin{cases}P_e(i),&i<|P_e|,\\\\3,&i\\ge|P_e|.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"t_e(i):=I_e(i)\\bmod4,\\quad a_e(i):=\\lfloor I_e(i)/4\\rfloor,\\quad b_e(i):=\\pi_0(a_e(i)),\\quad j_e(i):=\\pi_0(\\pi_1(a_e(i))),\\quad k_e(i):=\\pi_1(\\pi_1(a_e(i))).","display":true},{"tex":"H_e(i,r)\\iff t_e(i)=3,\\qquad O_e(i,r):=\\begin{cases}r(a_e(i)),&i<|P_e|,\\\\0,&i\\ge|P_e|.\\end{cases}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta_e^A(i,r):=\\begin{cases}\n(\\pi_1(a_e(i)),r[b_e(i)\\mapsto r(b_e(i))+1]),&t_e(i)=0,\\\\\n(j_e(i),r[b_e(i)\\mapsto r(b_e(i))-1]),&t_e(i)=1\\land r(b_e(i))>0,\\\\\n(k_e(i),r),&t_e(i)=1\\land r(b_e(i))=0,\\\\\n(j_e(i),r),&t_e(i)=2\\land r(b_e(i))\\in\\operatorname{AsSet}(A),\\\\\n(k_e(i),r),&t_e(i)=2\\land r(b_e(i))\\notin\\operatorname{AsSet}(A),\\\\\n(i,r),&t_e(i)=3.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"q_e(i,r):=\\begin{cases}\\{r(b_e(i))\\},&t_e(i)=2,\\\\\\varnothing,&t_e(i)\\ne2.\\end{cases}\\qquad r_x(j):=\\begin{cases}x,&j=0,\\\\0,&j>0.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"c_e^A(x,0):=(0,r_x),\\qquad c_e^A(x,s+1):=\\delta_e^A(c_e^A(x,s)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Exec}(e,A,x,s,y,Q)\\iff H_e(c_e^A(x,s))\\land(\\forall t<s\\;\\neg H_e(c_e^A(x,t)))\\land y=O_e(c_e^A(x,s))\\land Q=\\bigcup_{t<s}q_e(c_e^A(x,t)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{graph}(\\Phi_e^A):=\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Q\\in[\\mathbb N]^{<\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{Exec}(e,A,x,s,y,Q)\\},\\qquad\\varphi_e^A:=\\Phi_e^A,\\qquad\\varphi_e:=\\Phi_e^\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\iff(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(\\Phi_e^A),\\quad\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow\\iff x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^A),\\quad\\Phi_e^A(x)\\uparrow\\iff x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{graph}(u_e^A):=\\{(x,m)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\\exists s,y,Q\\;(\\operatorname{Exec}(e,A,x,s,y,Q)\\land m=\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{j+1:j\\in Q\\}))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{graph}(\\Phi_e^\\tau):=\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Q\\subseteq|\\tau|\\;(\\chi_A\\upharpoonright|\\tau|=\\tau\\land\\operatorname{Exec}(e,A,x,s,y,Q))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi_e^\\tau(x)\\downarrow=y\\iff(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(\\Phi_e^\\tau),\\qquad\\Phi_e^\\tau(x)\\downarrow\\iff x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^\\tau),\\qquad\\Phi_e^\\tau(x)\\uparrow\\iff x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^\\tau).","display":true},{"tex":"f\\simeq g\\iff\\operatorname{graph}(f)=\\operatorname{graph}(g).","display":true},{"tex":"f(x)\\simeq g(z)\\iff(x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\land z\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(g))\\lor\\exists v\\in E\\;((x,v)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(f)\\land(z,v)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(g)).","display":true}],"bytes":4795,"backlinks":[{"id":"ea9cbc7f8cc8654f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$B\\in\\mathcal O$，$e\\in\\mathbb N$；$D$ 为 [[43-df-effective-coding]] 中带指定编码的声明环境域，$S\\subseteq D$。自然数集合使用 $D=\\mathbb N$，串集及元组关系使用各自产品域。$X\\in2^\\omega$。$\\Phi_e^B$、$\\operatorname{Computable}_{D,E}^B$ 采用 [[43-df-oracle-computation]]、[[43-df-computable]]。无下标 $\\operatorname{CE},\\operatorname{CoCE},\\operatorname{ComputableSet}$ 按所声明的集合域 $D$ 使用；以序列为参数时用下式序列分支。"},{"id":"6bfdcc738fbd87ec","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Phi:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega$；$\\varphi_e^X$ 是 [[43-df-oracle-computation]] 中的预言机程序，将序列X与自然数集合预言机识别。"},{"id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"abd2ac3cf0e63c86","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"323b0a74dc337ecf","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"30257659a1c56ffc","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"91bad7e9096c3b8f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\Phi_e^A$ 见 [[43-df-oracle-computation]]；$\\mathrm{Order}$ 见 [[43-df-order-function]]；$\\mathrm{CETrace}$ 见 [[43-df-ce-trace]]。$h$ 下式限于 $\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$J^A:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$ 由下式函数图定义。"},{"id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anc