,"excerpt":"$A,B\\in\\mathcal O$；$\\operatorname{AsSequence}$ 采用 [[43-df-infseq]]，$\\operatorname{Exec}$ 采用 [[43-df-oracle-computation]]。$b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 全定义；有限自然数 $b(x)$ 同时是位置集合 $\\{j:j<b(x)\\}$。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-oracle-computation]] — 预言机计算与可接受编号"},{"id":"d74cf642b5d1413a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{OrderComplex}$、$\\operatorname{DNC}$、$\\Phi_e^X,u_e^X$、$\\operatorname{Computable}$ 见 [[43-df-order-complexity]]、[[43-df-dnc]]、[[43-df-oracle-computation]]、[[43-df-computable]]。所量化 $f,b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 均总定义。"},{"id":"a7de81180aabd02e","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $A,B\\in2^\\omega$，并按特征集合识别预言机。$\\oplus$、$\\le_T$、$\\Phi_e^B$、$\\operatorname{MLRandom}$、ML检验和公平硬币测度见 [[43-df-turing-join]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-oracle-computation]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-mltest]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]。"},{"id":"e94ffc08db5cedf1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi_e$ 与部分函数外延相等 $\\simeq$ 采用 [[43-df-oracle-computation]]；$\\operatorname{Computable}$ 采用 [[43-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"eed0edda3cc36fc5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi_e$ 与部分函数外延相等 $\\simeq$ 采用 [[43-df-oracle-computation]]；$\\operatorname{Computable}$ 采用 [[43-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"8d72cd0153942f61","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi_e$ 采用 [[43-df-oracle-computation]]，$\\operatorname{Computable}$ 采用 [[43-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"2b47c28942191578","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\in\\mathcal O$，$e,x,y,m\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y$ 且 $u_e^A(x)=m$。计算、使用量及共同oracle域采用 [[43-df-oracle-computation]]；$\\operatorname{AsSequence}$ 采用 [[43-df-infseq]]。"}],"outgoing":["267fe4584e3c0212","aa3